WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.768
Weeks of a brutal and deadly assault.

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:02.869
The Russian mercenary group

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:03.703
Wagner claims

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.871
it has captured

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:06.172
the eastern Ukrainian city

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:06.806
of Bakambu

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.575
to Wagner posted a video of its soldiers

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.610
holding up the Russian flag and claiming

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.411
that they

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.545
had captured the town

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:15.348
after 224 days of brutal fighting.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:17.817
Now, the leaders of Ukraine deny this.

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:18.184
They say

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.320
Ukrainian forces are still in control

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.255
of buildings flanking back.

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:22.856
CNN's Nic

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.491
Robertson is in eastern Ukraine for us.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:26.860
And Nick, you're near the front lines.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.929
Is this a potential defeat problem attic

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.632
for Ukraine in the long run?

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:34.801
Yes, it is.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.202
It's a morale issue.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.604
It's a moral issue for them

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:38.538
and for the Russians.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.540
The Russians gained something.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.776
This is a tough war for the Ukrainians.

00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:44.611
They've lost this.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:46.413
It makes many soldiers question

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.380
their political leaders

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.815
that they made the right decision,

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.050
lose so many soldiers.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.818
The kind of narrative is

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:52.852
sucked up

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:55.755
and and killed a lot of Russian troops.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.924
But if Russia pushes through back

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:59.359
mud and comes over the hill

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:00.794
and through the countryside beyond,

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:02.295
it moves on to the next towns.

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:03.663
And there's no doubting that

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:04.664
that's their target

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.900
as we were along the front lines

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.335
that are very, very close to back mud.

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:10.770
And you get the real sense

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:14.541
from soldiers there that this war just is

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:16.943
giving them a kick in

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:24.150
barely out of the armored troop carrier,

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:27.187
incoming artillery

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:33.093
but I'm up.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:33.860
We're just going to wait

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.128
in this little basement

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:36.596
