00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:43.136
Safe to come out at this army

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:46.172
outpost a few miles from back.

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.041
Last night was hard.

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:49.342
A lot of shelling

